Orlin Valley Gas made a margin call on us this morning for $4.2 million. The wire has to leave by 2:00 PM today or they have the right to suspend deliveries under the master agreement. Treasury will not release it without your approval. Please call me or reply as soon as you see this.

Noriko"}}

